# Every text file is checked out with LF line endings, also on Windows where
# Git defaults to CRLF: the shell scripts in rootfs/ are copied into the image
# as they are, and a "#!/usr/bin/with-contenv bash\r" shebang does not run
# (the GPU host build on Docker Desktop would boot without any PotatOS setup).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
